msgid "Khushu"
msgstr "Khushu"

#: data/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.desktop.in
#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in src/main.rs
msgid "An all-in-one Muslim app for Linux"
msgstr "Aplikasi serba guna untuk umat Muslim di Linux"

#: data/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.desktop.in
msgid "Prayer;Islam;Salah;"
msgstr "Doa;Islam;Shalat;"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Khushu is your all-in-one Muslim app for Linux desktop, tablets, and "
"smartphones. It centralizes your daily worship by providing accurate prayer "
"times, native staggered Adkar notifications, and a dedicated Noble Quran "
"reader with ayah-by-ayah recitation."
msgstr ""
"Khushu adalah aplikasi Muslim lengkap untuk Linux di desktop, tablet, dan "
"ponsel pintar. Semua kebutuhan ibadah harian Anda tersedia dalam satu "
"aplikasi, mulai dari jadwal salat yang akurat, notifikasi adzkar bawaan yang "
"bertahap, hingga pembaca Al-Qur'an dengan murattal ayat per ayat."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Morning, Evening, and Night Adkar with built-in counters"
msgstr "Al-Ma'surat Pagi, Sore, dan Malam dengan penghitung bawaan"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Customizable Adhan system notifications (Makkah/Madinah audio)"
msgstr ""
"Pemberitahuan sistem adzan yang dapat disesuaikan (audio Makkah/Madinah)"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Dedicated Noble Quran reader with authentic Uthmanic text, multi-language "
"translations, ayah-by-ayah recitation, selectable reciters, and adjustable "
"typography"
msgstr ""
"Pembaca Al-Qur'an dengan teks Utsmani autentik, terjemahan multibahasa, "
"murattal ayat per ayat, pilihan qari, serta tipografi yang dapat disesuaikan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Interactive Qibla compass"
msgstr "Kompas arah Kiblat interaktif"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Hijri calendar mapping"
msgstr "Pemetaan kalender Hijriah"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Privacy-first local encryption for your location data"
msgstr "Enkripsi lokal yang mengutamakan privasi untuk data lokasi Anda"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Modern Libadwaita interface with adaptive Dark Mode"
msgstr "Antarmuka Libadwaita modern dengan Mode Gelap yang adaptif"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Multi-language support"
msgstr "Dukungan multibahasa"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Welcome & Onboarding: Easy first-time setup for location, language, and "
"calculation method"
msgstr ""
"Selamat Datang &amp; Panduan Awal: Pengaturan awal yang mudah untuk lokasi, "
"bahasa, dan metode perhitungan"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Prayer Times Dashboard: View accurate daily Salah times, upcoming prayer "
"countdown, and Hijri date"
msgstr ""
"Dasbor Waktu Shalat: Lihat jadwal shalat harian yang akurat, hitung mundur "
"waktu shalat berikutnya, dan tanggal Hijriah"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Hijri Calendar: Browse the full Islamic calendar with accurate Hijri date "
"mapping"
msgstr ""
"Kalender Hijriah: Lihat kalender Islam lengkap dengan pemetaan tanggal "
"Hijriah yang akurat"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Interactive Qibla compass pointing to Mecca via GPS or E-Compass sensor"
msgstr ""
"Kompas Kiblat interaktif yang menunjuk ke arah Mekah melalui GPS atau sensor "
"E-Compass"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Noble Quran: Read Arabic ayat and translations with adjustable typography "
"and listen to recitations with selectable reciters"
msgstr ""
"Al-Qur'an: Baca ayat dalam bahasa Arab beserta terjemahannya, sesuaikan "
"tipografi, dan dengarkan murattal dengan pilihan qari."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adkar & Supplications: Access Daily Adkar with built-in counters and "
"staggered notifications"
msgstr ""
"Al - Ma'surat dan Permohonan: Akses Al-Ma'surat harian dengan penghitung "
"bawaan dan notifikasi bertahap"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"App Settings: Configure your location, language, appearance, and prayer "
"settings"
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan Aplikasi: Atur lokasi, bahasa, tampilan, dan pengaturan doa Anda"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Djalel Oukid"
msgstr "Djalel Oukid"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "prayer"
msgstr "doa"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "salah"
msgstr "shalat"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "adhan"
msgstr "adzan"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "adkar"
msgstr "al-ma'surat"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "quran"
msgstr "al-qur'an"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "recitation"
msgstr "murattal"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "qibla"
msgstr "kiblat"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "muslim"
msgstr "muslim"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "islam"
msgstr "islam"

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added a searchable timezone selection dialog with local time preview and UTC "
"offset details"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan dialog pemilihan zona waktu dengan pencarian, pratinjau waktu "
"lokal, dan detail selisih UTC."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added user-selectable high-latitude rules and polar estimation methods"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan aturan lintang tinggi yang dapat dipilih pengguna serta Metode "
"Estimasi Wilayah Kutub."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added status notifications for high-latitude and polar estimation methods"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan notifikasi status untuk metode lintang tinggi dan Metode "
"Estimasi Wilayah Kutub."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed missed prayer notifications after system sleep or system clock "
"adjustments"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki notifikasi waktu salat yang terlewat setelah sistem bangun dari "
"mode tidur atau setelah penyesuaian jam sistem."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed Iqamah and morning Adkar notification timing to prevent overlap with "
"Adhan playback"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki waktu notifikasi iqamah dan adzkar pagi agar tidak bertumpang "
"tindih dengan pemutaran azan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Modernized the reciter selection dialog layout"
msgstr "Memodernisasi tata letak dialog pemilihan qari."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added high-latitude prayer time estimation (LocalRelativeEstimation for "
"48.6°–66.5° and NearestLatitude polar fallback for >66.5°)"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan estimasi waktu salat untuk wilayah lintang tinggi "
"(LocalRelativeEstimation untuk lintang 48.6°–66.5° dan NearestLatitude "
"sebagai metode cadangan untuk wilayah kutub di atas 66.5°)."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Migrated prayer time library from salah to mawaqit for high-latitude and "
"polar zone support"
msgstr ""
"Memigrasikan pustaka waktu salat dari `salah` ke `mawaqit` untuk mendukung "
"wilayah lintang tinggi dan zona kutub."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed blank label in KDE tray settings"
msgstr "Memperbaiki label kosong pada pengaturan ikon tray di KDE."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed verse highlighting, navigation, and recitation on multi-Surah pages"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki penyorotan ayat, navigasi, dan murattal pada halaman yang memuat "
"beberapa surah."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Surah header now updates when clicking a verse from a different Surah on "
"multi-Surah pages"
msgstr ""
"Judul surah kini diperbarui secara otomatis saat mengeklik ayat dari surah "
"lain pada halaman yang memuat beberapa surah."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Translated Surah name labels now truncate with ellipsis to prevent overflow "
"on narrow windows"
msgstr ""
"Label nama surah terjemahan kini dipersingkat dengan elipsis (…) agar tidak "
"melampaui batas pada jendela yang sempit."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Reduced memory usage by sharing Quran data between callers instead of "
"cloning it"
msgstr ""
"Mengurangi penggunaan memori dengan membagikan data Al-Qur'an antar "
"pemanggil, alih-alih menggandakannya."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed tray icon always showing dark on GNOME/XFCE in Flatpak"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki masalah ikon tray yang selalu tampil gelap di GNOME dan XFCE "
"pada Flatpak."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed lock-poison panics in tray FFI/D-Bus code"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki panic akibat lock poisoning pada kode FFI dan D-Bus untuk ikon "
"tray."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Removed tray icon file-copy workaround and its associated Flatpak filesystem "
"permission"
msgstr ""
"Menghapus solusi sementara penyalinan berkas ikon tray beserta izin akses "
"sistem berkas Flatpak yang terkait."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added Noble Quran Recitation with ayah-by-ayah audio playback and reciter "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan Murattal Al-Qur'an dengan pemutaran audio ayat per ayat dan "
"pilihan qari."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Rewrote locale switching for consistent i18n across all modules."
msgstr ""
"Mekanisme pergantian bahasa ditulis ulang untuk memastikan konsistensi i18n "
"di seluruh aplikasi."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed tray icon invisible on KDE dark panel."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki masalah ikon tray yang tidak terlihat pada panel gelap KDE."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed Arabic mushaf search scroll navigation."
msgstr "Memperbaiki navigasi gulir saat pencarian mushaf Arab."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed pagination boundary alignment for accurate mushaf-style navigation."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki penyelarasan batas halaman untuk navigasi gaya mushaf yang lebih "
"akurat."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added Indonesian (id) translation by WiqbalRar."
msgstr "Terjemahan bahasa Indonesia (id) oleh WiqbalRar telah ditambahkan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed custom audio save crash on non-main thread."
msgstr ""
"Crash saat menyimpan audio kustom di luar thread utama berhasil diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed language not persisting after app restart."
msgstr ""
"Masalah bahasa yang tidak tersimpan setelah aplikasi dimulai ulang telah "
"diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed data loss on exit with synchronous atomic config save."
msgstr "Fixed data loss on exit with synchronous atomic config save."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed autostart portal command double-wrapping."
msgstr ""
"Masalah pembungkus ganda pada perintah autostart portal telah diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed notification toggles reverting on restart due to UI override."
msgstr ""
"Masalah tombol pengaturan notifikasi yang kembali ke pengaturan awal saat "
"perangkat dihidupkan ulang akibat penggantian antarmuka pengguna telah "
"diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed audio selection reverting on restart due to file check on bundled "
"presets."
msgstr ""
"Fixed audio selection reverting on restart due to file check on bundled "
"presets."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved audio playback engine with streaming decode."
msgstr "Improved audio playback engine with streaming decode."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved Qibla compass performance with Pango and bearing caching."
msgstr ""
"Peningkatan kinerja kompas kiblat berkat Pango dan penyimpanan data arah."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved timer controller with daily state caching."
msgstr ""
"Pengendali timer yang disempurnakan dengan penyimpanan sementara status "
"harian."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved config persistence with singleton save channel."
msgstr "Improved config persistence with singleton save channel."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed application crashes caused by notification re-entrancy."
msgstr "Fixed application crashes caused by notification re-entrancy."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed configuration data race when saving from multiple threads."
msgstr "Fixed configuration data race when saving from multiple threads."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed thread safety issues in locale setup and audio initialization."
msgstr "Fixed thread safety issues in locale setup and audio initialization."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Replaced 26 unsafe unwrap() calls with proper error messages."
msgstr ""
"Mengganti 26 panggilan fungsi `unwrap()` yang tidak aman dengan pesan "
"kesalahan yang tepat."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added Adhan Only Mode toggle to keep only Adhan alerts."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan tombol pengaturan “Hanya Adzan” untuk menampilkan hanya "
"pemberitahuan adzan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added Iqamah Alert toggle to separately control Iqamah notifications."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan tombol pengaturan Iqamah buat mengatur notifikasi Iqamah secara "
"terpisah."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added new prayer calculation methods for France (UOIF), Algeria (Ministry of "
"Religious Affairs and Wakfs), and KEMENAG (Indonesia)."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan metode perhitungan waktu shalat baru untuk Prancis (UOIF), "
"Aljazair (Kementerian Urusan Agama dan Wakaf), dan KEMENAG (Indonesia)."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed Flatpak tray icon visibility with XDG portal icon path support."
msgstr ""
"Telah diperbaiki masalah visibilitas ikon baki Flatpak dengan dukungan jalur "
"ikon portal XDG."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Improved tray activation: clicking \"Open Khushu\" from system tray now "
"directly shows the app window."
msgstr ""
"Peningkatan fungsi baki sistem: mengklik “Buka Khushu” dari baki sistem kini "
"langsung menampilkan jendela aplikasi."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added a fully offline Noble Qur'an module featuring the Qur'anic text in "
"Uthmanic orthography (rasm), translations, mushaf-style navigation, "
"diacritic-aware search, saved reading positions, and adjustable typography."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan modul Al-Qur'an Karim yang sepenuhnya dapat digunakan secara "
"offline, yang menampilkan teks Al-Qur'an dalam ejaan Utsmaniyah (rasm), "
"terjemahan, navigasi bergaya mushaf, fitur pencarian yang mendukung tanda "
"baca, penyimpanan posisi bacaan, serta tipografi yang dapat disesuaikan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added Mawaqit API integration as an alternative prayer times source."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan integrasi API Mawaqit sebagai sumber waktu shalat alternatif."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added ICU-backed localization for location and timezone labels, plus "
"validated custom IANA timezone editing."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan lokalisasi yang didukung ICU untuk label lokasi dan zona waktu, "
"serta pengeditan zona waktu IANA khusus yang telah diverifikasi."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Reorganized settings into clearer General, Prayer Setup, and Alerts sections "
"with improved inline editing behavior."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan telah diorganisir ulang menjadi bagian-bagian yang lebih jelas, "
"yaitu Umum, Pengaturan Shalat, dan Pemberitahuan, dengan peningkatan pada "
"fitur pengeditan langsung."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed Snap tray icon visibility via an upstream patch to ksni (resolves "
"AppArmor D-Bus blocking)."
msgstr ""
"Perbaikan masalah visibilitas ikon baki Snap melalui tambalan hulu pada ksni "
"(mengatasi masalah pemblokiran D-Bus oleh AppArmor)."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed Snap autostart and notification icon rendering."
msgstr ""
"Masalah terkait pengaktifan otomatis Snap dan tampilan ikon notifikasi telah "
"diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved locale detection and fallback logic."
msgstr "Peningkatan dalam deteksi wilayah dan logika cadangan."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed Flatpak autostart failure and missing --background flag."
msgstr ""
"Perbaikan masalah kegagalan autostart Flatpak dan hilangnya opsi --"
"background."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Fixed over-translation of proper nouns (e.g., Muslim) in non-English locales."
msgstr ""
"Masalah terjemahan berlebihan pada nama-nama khusus (misalnya, Muslim) di "
"wilayah non-Inggris telah diperbaiki."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Added new localized AppStream screenshots for improved store presence."
msgstr ""
"Telah ditambahkan tangkapan layar AppStream yang telah dilokalkan untuk "
"meningkatkan daya tarik di toko aplikasi."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed tray icon translation extraction (Quit and Open Khushu entries)."
msgstr ""
"Perbaikan pengambilan terjemahan ikon baki (entri Keluar dan Buka Khushu)."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed AppStream metadata translation (descriptions and keywords)."
msgstr "Fixed AppStream metadata translation (descriptions and keywords)."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improved tray behavior to update labels immediately on language change."
msgstr ""
"Improved tray behavior to update labels immediately on language change."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Initial stable release of Khushu."
msgstr "Initial stable release of Khushu."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Accurate offline prayer (Salah) calculation methods, including recommended "
"high-latitude and polar estimation methods."
msgstr ""
"Metode kalkulasi waktu shalat luring yang akurat, termasuk metode estimasi "
"yang direkomendasikan untuk wilayah lintang tinggi dan kutub."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Added native Adkar translations in French, Spanish, Turkish, and Indonesian, "
"verified against authentic sources"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan terjemahan Adzkar asli dalam bahasa Prancis, Spanyol, Turki, dan "
"Indonesia yang terverifikasi dari sumber tepercaya."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Daily Adkar reminders now prioritize favorited Adkar over random selection"
msgstr ""
"Pengingat Adzkar harian kini memprioritaskan Adzkar favorit daripada pilihan "
"acak."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed the Indonesian UI selection not persisting after restart"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki masalah pilihan antarmuka bahasa Indonesia yang tidak tersimpan "
"setelah aplikasi dimuat ulang."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixed the invalid adhan file toast never showing"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki masalah notifikasi (toast) berkas adzan tidak valid yang tidak "
"pernah muncul."

#: data/appdata/io.github.sniper1720.khushu.metainfo.xml.in
